":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-rail","data-dock-active":"false","style":{"top":"94px"}},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-dock","hidden":true},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored life-ad-space-compact","data-ad-placement":"ad_dock","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"Advertisement · Community recommendation"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-ad-dismiss","aria-label":"Close ad"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-x","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 6 6 18"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 6 12 12"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"Official Shengcai Youshu logo","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["Advertisement · Community recommendation"]},{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Could what you know become a useful product?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["From ebooks to small tools, explore how members spot needs and turn knowledge into something people can use."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-actions"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-link","href":"/en/shengcaiyoushu?sc_group=reading&sc_creative=read_product&sc_placement=ad_dock"},"children":["Explore the community and examples",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"18","height":"18","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M7 7h10v10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M7 17 17 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/en/book/19"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Back to index"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["While employed, upon leaving the job, and for work‑related injuries"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"data-ad-dock-host":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Chapter entries"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"Overtime pay is calculated at three rates: 1.5×, 2×, and 3× the regular wage; failure to pay warrants a complaint to labor authorities, and non‑payment after the deadline incurs an additional penalty of 50%–100% of the owed amount"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"Annual leave is calculated based on total years of service: 5, 10, or 15 days. If unused, employees receive 300% of their daily wage as compensation"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"There is a legal limit on probation periods, wages must be at least 80% of the regular rate, and only one probation period may be set per employee"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Calculating N: One month’s salary per full year of service; half a month for periods under six months"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"If a company fires you without 30 days’ notice, it must pay an extra month’s salary"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"When a company unlawfully terminates employment, the compensation equals twice the standard severance amount"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Never sign “voluntary resignation for personal reasons”; doing so forfeits your entitlements"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Save pay stubs, attendance records, employment contracts, social insurance documents, and chat logs before leaving your job"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Before taking up a post where there is dust, noise, or chemicals, check whether the contract mentions any occupational hazards; the employer must arrange and pay for three occupational health examinations"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Damage caused by dust, noise, and chemical toxins is irreversible: employers must provide protective gear, and workers can refuse unsafe tasks"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"If you’re injured at work or hit while commuting, the first step is to get a work‑injury determination; if your employer won’t file it, you must do it yourself"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Don’t believe the myth that “staying at work counts as a workplace injury”: if you suddenly feel unwell, call 120 first — don’t rush to clock in"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Even if the employer fails to enroll you in workers’ compensation insurance, you still qualify for full benefits paid entirely by the employer at the same rates"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"After injuries stabilize, undergo a work capacity assessment; disability grades translate directly into compensation"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Three types of compensation for work-related deaths: funeral allowance, survivor’s pension, and one-time death benefit"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"If you’ve been bullied, insulted, or mistreated at work for a long time, don’t just endure it: document everything as evidence, then take action based on the nature of the abuse"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/19-17","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"When you leave a job, ask the employer for a termination certificate stating contract term, separation date, position, and years of service"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Before spending severance pay, check individual income tax: amounts within three times the local prior-year average employee wage are tax-free; the excess is taxed separately, not merged into that year’s salary"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"When moving to another city for work, transfer your pension and medical insurance to the new place of enrollment; contribution years keep adding up, so do not withdraw from pension insurance"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/19"},"children":["Chapter 19"," ·"," ","While employed, upon leaving the job, and for work‑related injuries"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"19-17"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["17"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["When you leave a job, ask the employer for a termination certificate stating contract term, separation date, position, and years of service"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Whether you were dismissed, the contract expired, or you resigned, the employer must give you a termination certificate when you leave and transfer your personnel file and social insurance within 15 days. The certificate must state contract term, separation date, position, and how many years you worked there. You need it for unemployment registration. If the employer refuses, labor authorities order correction and must compensate any loss they caused."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost. Ask in person before you go, or send a written me…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The Labor Contract Law requires the employer to issue a certificate when the contract is terminated or ended.…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: When you leave a job, ask the employer for a termination certificate stating contract term, separation date, position, and years of service"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost. Ask in person before you go, or send a written message and keep proof you asked. The hard part is asking when relations are bad. If the employer stalls, complaints or arbitration can take weeks to months."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The Labor Contract Law requires the employer to issue a certificate when the contract is terminated or ended. The rule does not depend on who initiated it — non-renewal, resignation, or dismissal all count. The employer must also complete personnel file and social insurance transfer within 15 days. The implementing regulations require four items on the certificate: contract term, date of termination or end, job position, and years of service at the unit. The Unemployment Insurance Regulations require laid-off workers to take the employer’s certificate to the social insurance agency promptly for unemployment registration. Unemployment benefits start from the date of unemployment registration. If the employer does not issue a written certificate, the labor administration orders correction. If you suffer loss, the employer must pay damages. The law also provides that a new employer who hires someone still bound to a former employer and causes loss to the former employer bears joint and several liability. The termination certificate is written proof that you and the former employer have ended the relationship (nationwide)."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2012 修正). 劳动合同法（第五十、八十九、九十一条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3"]},"；国务院 (2008). 劳动合同法实施条例（国务院令第 535 号，第二十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8080816f3cbb3c016f40927caf049c","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8080816f3cbb3c016f40927caf049c"]},"；国务院 (1999). 失业保险条例（国务院令第 258 号，第十六条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=517","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=517"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2007). 劳动争议调解仲裁法（第二、二十七、四十三、五十三条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf64f28039d","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf64f28039d"]},"；国务院 (2004). 劳动保障监察条例（国务院令第 423 号，第十七条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2004/content_63042.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2004/content_63042.htm"]},"；国务院 (2006). 诉讼费用交纳办法（国务院令第 481 号，第六、十三、二十九条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/ziliao/flfg/2006-12/29/content_483682.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/ziliao/flfg/2006-12/29/content_483682.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["The law does not tie issuing the certificate to completing handover; economic compensation is paid after handover is done. If the employer drags its feet, send one more written demand. If still no certificate, call 12333 or complain to labor inspection at the human resources bureau. Complaints are free; after a case is opened, investigation must finish within 60 working days, extendable 30 days for complex cases. To claim damages from the employer, use labor arbitration — also free — within one year. After acceptance, arbitration closes within 45 days, extendable 15 days. You must prove the loss yourself, for example delayed unemployment registration or a new employer refusing you for lack of proof. If you disagree with the award, go to court; ordinary first-instance procedure starts at six months. Labor dispute court fees are 10 yuan per case; attorney fees are not litigation costs and you pay yourself. The four required items do not include reason for leaving. If the certificate says “voluntary resignation for personal reasons” and that is false, object on the spot — see this section item 7 (do not sign voluntary resignation). How to claim unemployment insurance: Section 7, item 1."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/19-16"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"